wolf Cave</a>, behind the teleport which is located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32992,31443,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32992, 31443, 7)</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p> <b>Hemming</b> runs in low health.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p> <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a> and Mages</b>: Run him around the room while shooting <a href=\"#/wiki/Assassin%20Star\">Assassin Stars</a>/Prismatic Bolts/SDs. If he uses <a href=\"#/wiki/Haste\">Haste</a>, you may need to do the same to keep distance. Make sure to use Exura or Exura Gran if he catches up to you.<br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a></b>: Shoot a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bomb\">Fire Bomb</a> onto the floor somewhere, then attack <b>Hemming</b> and move into the middle of the fire bomb. <b>Hemming</b> will come after you onto the fire, but his <a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Wolf\">War Wolves</a> will not. Thus you will avoid having your shielding broken and will take considerably less melee damage.\n</p><p><b>Note:</b> Do not bother killing the <a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Wolf\">War Wolves</a> as they will most likely be summoned again very quickly.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 75 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 50 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pse